# Project overview

**Cross-Border** monorepo:

| Area | Path | Role |
|------|------|------|
| Panel UI | `apps/web/` | React + Vite, base `/ui/` |
| API | `src/server/` | FastAPI; register routers in `api/registry.py` |
| Gateway | `src/gateway/` | Agent tools, workflows, schedules, integrate channels |
| Scrape | `src/core/`, `src/pipeline/` | Engine, plugins, product store |
| Deploy | `src/deploy/`, `libs/store_drivers/` | VPS scripts, drivers, firewall |
| Runtime config | `config/` (root) | YAML/JSON on disk |
| Settings code | `src/config/` | Python `Settings`, `.env` |

**Orchestration boundary:** FastAPI gateway only. Web and CLI are clients.

**Docs:** `AGENTS.md`, `ARCHITECTURE.md`, `docs/PROJECT_STRUCTURE.md`.

**Do not confuse:** `libs/agent_rules/` = runtime panel AI policies. `.cursor/rules/` = IDE agent guidance.
